    {
      "source": "Construct a new <code>RedisSentinelConfiguration</code> from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a>.",
