    {
      "source": "<a href=\"RedisConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>Configuration</code></a> class used to set up a <a href=\"RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a> with\n<a href=\"RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> for connecting to <a href=\"https://redis.io/topics/sentinel\">Redis Sentinel(s)</a>.\nUseful when setting up a highly available Redis environment.",
      "translation": "用于配置<a href=\"RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a>的<a href=\"RedisConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>Configuration</code></a>类，该连接通过<a href=\"RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a>连接到<a href=\"https://redis.io/topics/sentinel\">Redis Sentinel(s)</a>。在配置高可用 Redis 环境时非常有用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"RedisPassword.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisPassword</code></a> to use when connecting to a Redis Sentinel. <br/>\nCan be set via <a href=\"RedisConfiguration.SentinelConfiguration.html#setSentinelPassword(org.springframework.data.redis.connection.RedisPassword)\"><code>RedisConfiguration.SentinelConfiguration.setSentinelPassword(RedisPassword)</code></a> or <a href=\"RedisPassword.html#none()\"><code>RedisPassword.none()</code></a> if no password has\nbeen set.",
      "translation": "返回用于连接 Redis Sentinel 的<a href=\"RedisPassword.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisPassword</code></a>。<br/>\n可以通过<a href=\"RedisConfiguration.SentinelConfiguration.html#setSentinelPassword(org.springframework.data.redis.connection.RedisPassword)\"><code>RedisConfiguration.SentinelConfiguration.setSentinelPassword(RedisPassword)</code></a>或<a href=\"RedisPassword.html#none()\"><code>RedisPassword.none()</code></a>（如果尚未设置密码）进行设置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <code>RedisSentinelConfiguration</code> for given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>hostPort</code></a> combinations.\n\n<pre class=\"code\">sentinelHostAndPorts[0] = 127.0.0.1:23679\nsentinelHostAndPorts[1] = 127.0.0.1:23680 ...\n</pre>",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>hostPort</code></a>组合创建一个新的<code>RedisSentinelConfiguration</code>。\n\n<pre class=\"code\">sentinelHostAndPorts[0] = 127.0.0.1:23679\nsentinelHostAndPorts[1] = 127.0.0.1:23680 ...\n</pre>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
